{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_06",
  "title": "海鲜拼盘",
  "storyCode": "DT-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "51cc204ced9db2933a49aeb683d93a6dfb21f1ee3938972b7efb385b4e26892e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffday"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？这个声音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为他们会更加谨慎一些......没想到，他们自信到如此地步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，无论如何，结果是一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教会正是需要人手的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成为我们的一员吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，让我们共同为伊比利亚人带去启示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffday"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陷阱大概就这样吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下就等他们打够食材跑出来了，应该足够帮他们抵挡一下子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，莱欧斯这家伙，有些时候还是挺细致的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里怎么会有个箱子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......难道说，在这个世界也有宝箱怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，这家伙未免也太不专业了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在沙滩这么空无一物的地方，真的能骗到人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......？有脚步声......我猜，是那个神神道道的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们终会变成我们的兄弟手足，很快，很快，他们会变得更好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，这家伙......果然想让我们去送死吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffday"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等审判庭的人来了，正好拿他们试一试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "试什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你怎么没有进去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本来就没什么战斗能力，所以在等他们出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚才提到审判庭，那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那是我们共同的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以说给我听听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这个杜林看起来确实没什么战斗力......和他聊聊也没什么。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（就他这身板，他还能跑到哪里去呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里好像会被人看到......我们去那边那个箱子上聊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，我们就从审判庭对伊比利亚的欺瞒开始——咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（猛地打开）（吞食）（关闭）（欢快地晃动）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘴上说着兄弟，结果你对这些魔物也不怎么了解嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我们这一行，这样是会吃亏的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcave"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，总算全都干掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来以为会有很多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只像克拉肯的魔物死了之后，想必大部分也都逃走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杀死它的人比我们有口福呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森西，你怎么看，这些魔物能吃吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坚决不吃！看上去也太恶心了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在老夫看来，只要用心对待并妥善处理，这些魔物可以变成健康又美味的一餐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是这里距离那座城市并不远，也不算很隐蔽，没道理一直没被人发现吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里的人都不吃，不就是说明这些东西没法吃吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看那个神神秘秘的教士就是想骗我们来送死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里栖息着的毫无疑问是魔物......我们在那座城市里并没有见到有武装的人，他们可能也是有心无力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鲜是很好的蛋白质来源，如果能够用它们好好做一顿饭，肯定能让他们饱餐一顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行不行不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫觉得没有什么不妥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫虽然没有真正料理过克拉肯，但鱼贝虾章鱼都是处理过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提醒你一下，除了这些，我们能吃的就只有从海里冲上来的鱼和贝壳了哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这只的透明脑袋里面是......黏糊糊的液体？包裹着内脏和黄......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "内脏肯定是不能吃的，剩下的黄和液体倒出来看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很像鸡蛋啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等会儿放进碗里打散看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也觉得就是鸡蛋的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不是还在清理魔物吗，能不能请你们不要直接就开始研究要怎么吃了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话不能这么说，这也是研究魔物的最好手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔，你有没有发现，这种海葵一样的魔物，你已经帮我们料理好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还真的是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是被爆炸烤过以后，感觉已经有点烧焦了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有这些奇怪的海草，被烤干之后都脱落下来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该都不能吃了吧？要不别吃了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在老夫看来火候刚刚好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不再有魔物从洞窟深处涌来了，看来，它们畏惧了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，从魔物尸体的数量来看，也差不多够做一顿大餐了，我们走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffday"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......齐尔查克，你身边怎么有一只箱子......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，这个昏倒的人......是那个教士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，这教士想骗我们来这里送死，我稍微用这家伙惩罚了一下他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？这教士是骗人的？但我们确实打到了好多好多海鲜啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你说......“这家伙”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我就知道，就是它，这个世界也有宝箱怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（猛地打开）（被齐尔查克控制住）（吃不着）（愤怒地抖动）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......齐尔查克，你好熟练啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这家伙的伪装太烂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正你肯定打算尝尝这个世界的宝箱怪的味道吧，给你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，真的吗，齐尔查克，你真是个好人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）这算是在体谅他吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）......算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）齐尔查克，你人真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）闭嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我们去海滩上生火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffday"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先从这种海葵一样的魔物开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才我就在想了......应该是在这个地方......唔，在这里！看来它的头部是在下面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？上面这朵花一样的器官不是它的头吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拆下来看一下。头部看起来像是海星......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剥开看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，果然里面有黄！每一片“花瓣”上都有。看来现在是它的繁殖期呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这样一说我更不想吃了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不会再生吃水栖生物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早就说过，不经过处理就去生吃未知生物，肯定会吃坏肚子啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好处理过的正常的生腌和刺身都是很美味的。你自己好好反省吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那玛露西尔，正常的生食怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！搬起石头砸自己的脚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说嘛说嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酱油里放上芥末和柠檬、洋葱、香菜、蒜末，有鱼露的话也可以加一点，把生的海鲜放进去拌匀腌制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但我们没有酱油也没有芥末。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有这个。老夫刚刚在溶洞的角落发现了半箱......“应急理智顶液”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上面写着“含有少量芥末提取物”，可能是某种调味料吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“罗德岛生产”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我们要找的那个地方的商品。能在这里发现这个东西，说不定我们已经离目的地很近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，那正好就用它来给生食增添一些风味吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只需要把这些配菜切成合适的大小，倒进容器里，加入“应急理智顶液”，再把包里最后一点洋葱和蒜末放进去，然后倒入生食拌匀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尝一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吃！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于剩下的这些食材......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让老夫看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被烤过的海草一大把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟鸡蛋一样的魔物十几只。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十几只海葵型魔物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有一只宝箱怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，非常足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多就是这样吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一口气做了这么多，也还剩下好多食材，应该够城里那些人吃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好香的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......虽然是用魔物做的，但是这些料理看上去好像还不错的样子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们真的有打算分给城里人吗？我感觉你们已经要先开动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，城里的人听不懂我们说话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有个办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们先在海岸上吃，把在沙滩边游荡的人吸引过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们显然还是有知觉的，等他们吃饱了，再让他们去分给城里的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......根本就是你想先吃的借口吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，这里的人可能也没见过类似的食物，我们也得亲自示范，这些是能吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就开动吧，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还要海藻酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，真是个贪嘴的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为很好喝呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你喜欢就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望歌手下次来的时候也能喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那几个外人在海边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？他们在海边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在做饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做饭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用海里的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？！得快去阻止他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffday"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个生腌的味道好刺激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是口感很不错，很新鲜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个世界的宝箱怪味道也不错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亲族......大群......什么味道，好香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。那个骗人的教士醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太香了......嗯？！你们在干什么？你们、你们煮的是什么东西？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教士先生，你告诉我们的洞窟里，真的有好多海鲜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这下连城镇里的人们都不用再挨饿了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来尝尝吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你们......这是何等的亵渎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄、兄弟手足，我绝不允许——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完蛋了，教士先生又晕过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是饿晕了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有了！我们可以去海里捞一点刚才的奇怪海草，用被雷劈的感觉来把教士唤醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都说了他是江湖骗子了，你还这么关心他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "齐尔查克，不管怎么说，这顿海鲜大餐还是拜他所赐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凭着感恩之心，我们总该做点什么意思一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真搞不懂你。"
