      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜哇，海水好凉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安妮塔终于赶到了海边，但一切似乎都已经迟了。\n沉寂已久的海滩上，人们久违地聚集了起来。\n遥远海边的四人挽起裤腿，似乎是兴致勃勃地走入大海，时不时地发出嘻嘻哈哈的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！这里有小家伙会啃我的脚趾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？那、那我们刚刚吃的那些是不是也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是很正常的事，玛露西尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我好像听到后面有人在叫......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，那边还有一团会发光的！我要去看看了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊、啊啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
